# Ashfall - a new island of the library, twice the size (x2)
# A village on a volcanic table-land 22 m up, buried to its eaves in grey ash one night: the town hall, the bakery, the
# tool shed, the school and the chapel's spire sticking out of the drifts round a little bell house. Everyone got out -
# down a goat path to the old lava tube by the sea, the safe house nobody had used in a hundred years. The mayor's diary,
# torn into five pages, tells how; ring the bell three times as she did, and the shelter's gate opens.
# Quest "Under the Ash" (12 steps): a pages hunt through dug-out houses, rats, a shovel, a buried door, beetles in a
# crypt, a bell, and a shelter.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe ashfall) through the editor's own operations.
include lib_relay
include lib_huts
include lib_sea
new
# (nature: volcanic, Like Raft - few trees, scrub on the ash; a little green at the cliff foot by the sea)
gen Trees=0.2 Bushes=0.3 Rocks=0.5 Harvest=0.2 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=9209 Radius=63 Height=22 Roughness=0.4 Peaks=1 Shape=4 Style=4 BeachWidth=0.3 Cliffs=0.8 PeakShape=0.3
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.3 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.4 Hostiles=0
generate

# --- Terrain: the road up from the landing on the south shore - two legs cut into the cliff (to 12 m, then to the top);
# the goat path down the north-east cliff to the shelter's ledge by the sea (2 m); the chapel crypt's pit (4 m down) and
# the stair dug down into it; the spots of the bell house, the bakery and the tool shed levelled ---------------------------
