# --- The bell house on the village square: four posts three high, a deck of two by two boards, four more posts and a
# pyramid roof over it, the bell (a bucket hung upside down) under the roof, the last page on the deck; the ladder up its
# south side; the proclamation at its foot -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
